  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v3.11.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v3.10.0:\n\n- Fix the two Sonar findings this PR introduced ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Address the review comment and the analyzer findings from this PR ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Teach the AST what a property is, and where one lands ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Teach a declaration to carry metadata ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Teach a declaration the types it is written over ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Teach a type declaration what it implements and what it promises ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Make a node type that misses AstSchema or AstFields fail a test ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
